        <mxCell id="implementation-note" value="IMPLEMENTED BEHAVIOR&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Database-backed current user and role checks&lt;br&gt;- Order creator tracking&lt;br&gt;- Order item add, edit, and remove flows&lt;br&gt;- Status updates with history&lt;br&gt;- Transaction-safe yearly numbering&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Application rules may be stricter than FK cardinality: creating an order requires at least one item." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#f0fdf4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontColor=#111827;spacing=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
